### 测试1：检查用户名
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/check-username?username=testuser

### 测试2：注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser2",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "13987654322",
  "email": "new2@example.com"
}

### 测试3：登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser2",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 测试4：获取所有用户（不应返回密码）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### 测试5：获取单个用户（不应返回密码）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2

### 测试6：更新用户信息（只更新提供的字段）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13900000053",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}

### 测试7：注销用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/logout

### 测试8：验证更新结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2



### 阶段1：准备测试环境
### 清除可能存在的测试数据
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/clean-test-data

### 阶段2：测试注销功能
### 测试1：注册新测试用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "13812340001",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 测试2：登录用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 测试3：验证登录状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
### 应返回 lastLoginTime 有值

### 测试4：执行注销
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/logout

### 测试5：验证注销效果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
### 应返回：
### lastLoginTime: null
### isLoggedIn: false


### 阶段3：清理测试数据
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/2